	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_swplazmam1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プラズマだん『かつつもり　なのか！
クソー！　うぬぼれてやがる！▼
だけど　ぜんいんと　れんぞくで
たたかうのは　きびしいだろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-08T13:40:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T03:39:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プラズマ団『勝つつもり　なのか！
クソー！　うぬぼれてやがる！▼
だけど　全員と　連続で
戦うのは　厳しいだろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-08T13:40:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T03:39:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：1回目
・戦闘前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T03:39:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
